abstract: >
  Satellite-based land-use change detection comparing AlphaEarth 64-dimensional
  embeddings (cosine similarity) against LandTrendr NDVI spectral-temporal
  analysis across 15 western U.S. study sites (urbanization, wildfire, logging).
keywords:
  - remote sensing
  - change detection
  - Google Earth Engine
  - AlphaEarth
  - LandTrendr
  - land use
  - geospatial
